<title>UK: Robert Fleming Capital sets 400 mln DEM 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Robert Fleming Capital sets 400 mln DEM 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ROBERT FLEMING CAPITAL LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ROBERT FLEMING AND CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    20.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A	   ISS PRICE  99.83     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST IBCA  A+	  REOFFER    99.83</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		SENIOR DEBT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
